* B1 -- Ni2 on coronene | CASPT2 multistate-scheme sensitivity
* XMS-CASPT2 on the COMPACT CAS(12,12), QUINTET (S=2) manifold.
*
* Identical to 03c_caspt2_compact/caspt2_Q.input EXCEPT multistate -> xmulti
* (extended-multistate). Same active space, same cheap-tier natural orbitals
* (rasscf.RasOrb), same imag/IPEA shifts. Purpose: test whether the MS-CASPT2
* descriptor ordering (D2/D5 sweeps, SO spectrum) is stable to the XMS
* resolution of near-degenerate root mixing -- the reliability check the low
* reference weights (~0.39) call for. Compare the resulting RASSI-SO manifold
* against 03c_caspt2_compact (MS) with the same analysis pipeline.

&GATEWAY
 coord = opt_optimized.xyz
 basis = Def2-TZVP
 group = nosym
 amfi
 RICD

&SEWARD

&RASSCF
 fileorb = rasscf.RasOrb
 cionly
 charge = 0; spin = 5
 nactel = 12 0 0
 inactive = 100
 ras2 = 12
 ciroot = 5 5 1
 thrs = 1.0d-7 1.0d-5 1.0d-5
 outorbital = canonical

&CASPT2
 xmulti = 5 1 2 3 4 5
 imag = 0.2
 ipeashift = 0.25
